ttered) and deep fried. Curds are sometimes referred to as \"squeaky cheese\" or fromage en grain."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-cheese-curds"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheese_curds"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":1,"groups":[["English cuisine","cuisine/english-cuisine",[["Maids of honour tart","dish/maids-of-honour-tart"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Puff pastry","ingredient/puff-pastry"]]}],"img":{"src":"/world-cuisine/img/4/46/Cheese_Curds_with_scale_measurement.png","w":500,"h":503,"by":"User:Atyndall","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cheese_Curds_with_scale_measurement.png"}},"dish/cokertme-kebab":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/cokertme-kebab","n":"Çökertme kebabı","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Turkish cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Çökertme kebabı is a type of kebab eaten in Anatolia, and associated particularly with the Bodrum area of South West Turkey."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-cokertme-kebab"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%87%C3%B6kertme_kebab%C4%B1"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Turkish cuisine","cuisine/turkish-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Ozlem's Turkish Table","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"ozlemsturkishtable.com","note":"Turkish-born cook and teacher Ozlem Warren's blog of home-style Turkish recipes.","url":"https://ozlemsturkishtable.com/tag/turkish-recipes/page/9","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Turkish cuisine","links":[["Adana kebabı","dish/adana-kebab"],["Baba ghanoush","dish/baba-ghanoush"],["Bici bici","dish/bici-bici"],["Boortsog","dish/boortsog"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Çiğ köfte","dish/cig-kofte"],["Doner kebab","dish/doner-kebab"],["Düğün çorbası","dish/dugun-corbas"],["Eggplant jam","dish/eggplant-jam"],["İmam bay